EZ2DIGITIZE - Third-party components and licenses
=================================================

EZ2DIGITIZE itself is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

This file lists every third-party component, grouped by how it reaches the
user. Update it in the same commit that adds, removes or re-versions a
component. Before each release, check it against what the installer
actually contains.

Rules (see CLAUDE.md):
  - Every bundled component must have a GPL-3.0-compatible license.
  - Never bundle components under non-commercial (NC) or other
    non-free licenses; users may install those themselves as plugins.
  - For every bundled GPL/LGPL/AGPL binary, the exact corresponding source
    is published alongside the release.


